data: {"id": "52523e2c5e51454f-final", "run_id": "52523e2c5e51454f", "seq": 2922, "ts_ms": 1789125827119, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod `workload` 的 Volume `input` 引用了 ConfigMap `workload-input`，但挂载配置中请求的 Key `unavailable-key` 在 ConfigMap 中不存在，导致 Volume 挂载持续失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod Status | phase: Pending, condition Ready: False, ContainersNotReady | 确认 Pod 处于调度后、容器未启动的异常状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Container Status | container `app` waiting reason: ContainerCreating | 指向容器初始化或挂载阶段阻塞 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 直接定位挂载失败的具体配置错误原因 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubelet | FailedMount: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input] | 验证 Volume `input` 无法挂载的持续症状 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}`: 1 | 从监控侧佐证容器处于等待挂载状态 |\n\n**证据链说明：**\n- K8s State (事实 1, 2) 与 K8s Event (事实 3) 形成直接因果：Pod 处于 Pending 且容器等待中，原因是 kubelet 报告的 `FailedMount` 明确指出 ConfigMap 引用的 key 不存在。\n- Metric (事实 5) 从监控维度确认了容器等待状态的持续存在，排除了瞬时故障的可能性，与 K8s Event 中 `x20` / `x40` 的重复计数一致。\n- 容器重启次数为 0（未提供具体事实但状态为 ContainerCreating），证实容器从未成功启动，进一步锁定故障在初始化阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap workload-input 缺少 Key unavailable-key → Volume \"input\" 挂载校验失败 → 容器持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态 → Pod 保持 Pending，应用不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** Pod `workload` 的 Volume 挂载配置引用了 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`（见证据 #3）。\n\n该配置错误导致 kubelet 在挂载 Volume 时触发 `FailedMount` 错误，使 Pod 无法进入运行状态。K8s 状态（#1, #2）和 Metrics（#5）均证实了这一持续性的挂载阻塞现象。现有证据链完整，直接指向配置错误。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 44.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 539.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 539.1s (Evidence 533.4s, RCA 5.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 592.12, "metrics": {"run_id": "52523e2c5e51454f", "mttr": {"value": "9.9m", "seconds": 592.1268181800842, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 592126.8181800842, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 589632.3244571686, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 5403.607606887817, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2165.9982204437256}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 44804.39352989197, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 539150.4788398743, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8148.586750030518, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

